(7566300, 1213687, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>Your use of flash has captured the ladies very distinctly and sharply but there is the crux of the problem with the image for me. I am surprised that you have used flash in this way for this purpose in a challenge for motion blur, I think you would have fared better without flash at all. As it is there is minimal motion blur of the background only. What really spoils the image is the flash shadow on the foreground lady and the barring of the handle''s position in relation to her face. A better image would have been the second lady only but I still think the use of flash for this entry was ill-advised.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge Your use of flash has captured the ladies very distinctly and sharply but there is the crux of the problem with the image for me. I am surprised that you have used flash in this way for this purpose in a challenge for motion blur, I think you would have fared better without flash at all. As it is there is minimal motion blur of the background only. What really spoils the image is the flash shadow on the foreground lady and the barring of the handle''s position in relation to her face. A better image would have been the second lady only but I still think the use of flash for this entry was ill-advised.', '2018-04-17 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7566301, 1213680, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>A very appealing and colourful abstract Janine. It has very surreal quality to it, the pastel colours are also very appealing, it does leave me wondering what it is and how you have created it, which is always a good way to leave your viewer</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge A very appealing and colourful abstract Janine. It has very surreal quality to it, the pastel colours are also very appealing, it does leave me wondering what it is and how you have created it, which is always a good way to leave your viewer', '2018-04-17 12:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
